  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN225.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">poruḷ kaṭaikkūṭṭiya neñciṟkut talaimakaṉ colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What HE said to [his] heart that coveted wealth.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN225.1">
        <l>aṉpu maṭaṉuñ cāyalu miyalpu</l>
        <l>meṉpu nekiḻkkuṅ ki[ḷa]viyum piṟavu</l>
        <l>moṉṟupaṭu koḷkaiyō ṭōrāṅku muyaṅki</l>
        <l>yiṉṟē yivaṇa māki nāḷaip </l>
        <l>pu[ta]liva rāṭamait tumpi kuyiṉṟa</l>
        <l>vakalā vantuḷai kōṭai mukattali</l>
        <l>ṉīrkkiyaṅ kiṉaniraip piṉṟai vārkō</l>
        <l>lāykkuḻaṟ pāṇiyi ṉaituvan ticaikkun</l>
        <l>tēkkamal [cō]laik kaṭaṟōṅ karuñcurat</l>
        <l>tiyātta tūṇit talaitiṟan tavaipōṟ</l>
        <l>pūtta viruppaik kuḻaipoti kuviyiṇar</l>
        <l>kaḻaṟuḷai muttiṟ cennilat tutira</l>
        <l>maḻaituḷi maṟanta vaṅkuṭic cīṟūrc</l>
        <l>cēkkuvaṅ kollō neñcē pūppuṉai</l>
        <l>puyaleṉa volivarun tāḻiruṅ kūntaṟ</l>
        <l>ceṟitoṭi muṉkainaṅ kātali</l>
        <l>yaṟi[va]ñar nōkkamum pulaviyu niṉaintē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l>While, embracing [her] like one with the notion that</l>
        <l>love, innocence, grace, nature,</l>
        <l corresp="1-3">speech that makes bones melt and other things are one,</l>
        <l corresp="4">we are here today, tomorrow,</l>
        <l corresp="9">in the high difficult desert of the wildernesses with groves dense with teak trees,</l>
        <l>where the dancing bamboo that climbs the bushes, because the west wind</l>
        <l corresp="5f">pulls on the narrow pretty holes bored by bees,</l>
        <l corresp="8">comes wonderfully [and] sounds like the tunes from herders’ flutes,</l>
        <l corresp="7">with [their] longs staffs [going] behind the herds that move towards the water,</l>
        <l corresp="14a-c">shall we dwell, o heart,</l>
        <l corresp="13">in a little village with pretty homes that is forgotten by the rain drops,</l>
        <l corresp="11">while the piling clusters loaded with sprouts of the blooming Mahua trees,</l>
        <l corresp="10">similar to [arrows] whose ends are open  in the tied quiver,</l>
        <l corresp="12">drop [their fruit] on the red ground like pearls from the eroding holes,</l>
        <l corresp="17">thinking of the vexation and looks of knowing grief</l>
        <l corresp="16">from our beloved, tight bangles on [her] forearm,</l>
        <l corresp="14d-15">hanging dark tresses that start  being luxuriant like rain, adorned with flowers.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
